SGLang Team (SGLang)

    SGLang is one of the two engines this benchmark's tasks target: 17 of the 37
    tasks declare engine = "sglang" in task.toml. The engine is NOT distributed
    with this software and no SGLang source tree is included: the tasks launch
    `sglang.launch_server` from an install the task image builds, and drive it over
    SGLang's own HTTP API. Install it from https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang.
    SGLang is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    Some tasks' reference solutions under solution/ are diffs against SGLang, so
    the files those patches add are distributed here. Where such a patch carries a
    whole third-party tree, that tree's own LICENSE file is carried with it inside
    the patch.

