Model weights and datasets

    NOT distributed. No model weights are included. All ten model-support tasks
    resolve a checkpoint at image build time from the file list pinned in
    environment/model-manifest.json, whose 672 entries carry 540 sha256 digests.
    Each task's task.toml names the model it uses, and the model's own card carries
    its terms. No task in this release declares a gated model.

    A small number of tasks ship dataset fixtures under environment/public/,
    redistributed under their own terms.

_____________________

CUDA, Python and container base images

    NOT distributed. Each task's environment/Dockerfile builds FROM an upstream
    base image -- 20 of the 45 Dockerfiles that reference an external image pin
    every such reference by sha256 digest, the rest pin by tag -- and installs its
    own dependencies. Those images and packages carry their own licences.
